  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "home-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1830,
      "w": 420,
      "page": "home",
      "text": "The five-region Home from the recovery doc (§7), on one stable skeleton.\nLeft: World F, 'one life, several horizons' — the Returned-Saturday default.\nMiddle: Quiet — calm is a posture, not an empty page."
    },
    {
      "id": "places-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4020,
      "w": 440,
      "page": "places",
      "text": "Four states of one navigable encounter — New York → Red Hook → the Sorrento threshold comparison → the live Saturday interval.\nScope narrows left to right; the interval, dinner constraint, and Sorrento evidence persist.\nFrame 4 is the founder-approved stress-test board, reused verbatim."
    },
    {
      "id": "stress-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6230,
      "w": 400,
      "page": "stress",
      "text": "The reuse bet's worst case: can the warm-paper kernel render an operational live-route instrument?\nHOLD is the fixture default; ACT NOW is the hard case. Founder-approved — kept for provenance."
    },
    {
      "id": "handoff-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 10230,
      "w": 460,
      "page": "handoff",
      "text": "Home never sends the person to generic Places to rediscover why they tapped.\nTwo rows of the destination table drawn as pairs; the typed envelope made visible between the phones.\nIn the product the envelope is invisible — its proof is that the destination already knows."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixtures-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12630,
      "w": 470,
      "page": "fixtures",
      "text": "The four remaining evidence worlds from the five-world pack, each as Home | value receipt | Places.\nEach exercises a different register: F2 the temporal posture (closure, not homework), F3 photography-as-evidence, F4 attributed dual lanes (multiplayer as perception), F5 the governed urgency register.\nEvery receipt carries its own 'beats silence because' and 'forbidden here' rails."
    },
    {
      "id": "canon-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 16030,
      "w": 470,
      "page": "canon",
      "text": "The canon set, complete: the eight rulings (all ruled 08-30, #1 amended — the read restored), the Home posture matrix (one skeleton, six postures), and the Places completion — the mast-less ordinary open, the four admissible social forms escaped from trip scope, and one Place degrading honestly across four evidence conditions.\nStep 2 done. Next: promotion — one accepted decision doc + the Home-root and Places-root surface contracts."
    },
    {
      "id": "specimens-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 20030,
      "w": 460,
      "page": "specimens",
      "text": "The parts drawer: every kind from the unit unions rendered once, isolated, with its union name and build grade (oxblood = build, gold = adapt, green = exists).\nCompositions live on the other pages; grades and evidence gates in the build manifest doc."
    }
